  e, portanto,
  \[\text{Corr}(X,Y) = \frac{\text{Cov}(X,Y)}{\sqrt{\text{Var}(X)}\sqrt{\text{Var}(Y)}} = \frac{E(XY)-E(X)E(Y)}{\sqrt{\text{Var}(X)}\sqrt{\text{Var}(Y)}} = -0.202\]

